{"format":1,"key":"zone:arathibasin","path":"/lore/zone/arathibasin","name":"Arathi Basin","kind":"zone","label":"Zone","zone":{"key":"arathibasin","name":"Arathi Basin","path":"/lore/zone/arathibasin"},"levels":"","description":"Arathi Basin is a fertile valley in the Arathi Highlands and one of the main fronts in the war between the humans and the Forsaken. The League of Arathor…","intro":["Arathi Basin is a fertile valley in the Arathi Highlands and one of the main fronts in the war between the humans and the Forsaken. The League of Arathor fights to reclaim the lost lands of Arathor for its backers in Stormwind, while the Defilers, elite Forsaken troops under the dreadlord Varimathras, seek to cut the vital link between the humans and their dwarven allies to the south. Both sides battle for the basin's farm, stables, lumber mill, blacksmith and gold mine, whose resources feed the war."],"sections":[{"t":"The Larder of Arathor","p":["Long before the Third War, the basin's fields, mills and mines fed the realm of Stromgarde, heir to ancient Arathor. When Lordaeron fell and Stromgarde crumbled, the valley was left almost undefended, its farmsteads and workshops still standing. Whoever holds them now holds grain, timber, iron and gold, the stuff that keeps an army in the field. That makes the quiet valley one of the most fought-over places in the highlands."]},{"t":"The League and the Defilers","p":["The League of Arathor is an Alliance company of Stromgarde's survivors and their friends, backed by Stormwind and working out of Refuge Pointe, sworn to reclaim the lands their forebears built. The Defilers are the Forsaken's answer: hardened troops of the Undercity under the watchful eye of Varimathras, operating alongside the Horde at Hammerfall. Their aim is to strip the basin of its riches and sever the road that ties the northern humans to the dwarves of the south."]},{"t":"Holding the Basin","p":["Five strongpoints decide the battle: the farm, the stables, the lumber mill, the blacksmith and the gold mine. Each side races to raise its banner over them and defend what it takes, because every strongpoint held adds to its store of resources. Raiders slip between them to steal a point while the enemy is busy elsewhere, and the side that gathers enough resources first wins the basin, for a time."]}],"clips":[],"sources":[{"kind":"wiki","title":"Refuge Pointe","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Refuge_Pointe"},{"kind":"wiki","title":"Hammerfall","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Hammerfall"}],"related":[{"p":"/lore/zone/arathi","n":"Arathi Highlands","k":"zone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/refuge-pointe","n":"Refuge Pointe","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/hammerfall","n":"Hammerfall","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/stromgarde-keep","n":"Stromgarde Keep","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/npc/varimathras","n":"Varimathras","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/topic/forsaken","n":"Forsaken","k":"topic"},{"p":"/lore/topic/alliance","n":"Alliance","k":"topic"},{"p":"/lore/topic/horde","n":"Horde","k":"topic"}],"children":[{"p":"/lore/quest/8080-arathi-basin-mark-of-honor","n":"Arathi Basin Mark of Honor!","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/8154-arathi-basin-mark-of-honor","n":"Arathi Basin Mark of Honor!","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/8155-arathi-basin-mark-of-honor","n":"Arathi Basin Mark of Honor!","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/8156-arathi-basin-mark-of-honor","n":"Arathi Basin Mark of Honor!","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/8297-arathi-basin-mark-of-honor","n":"Arathi Basin Mark of Honor!","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/8262-arathor-advanced-care-package","n":"Arathor Advanced Care Package","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/8260-arathor-basic-care-package","n":"Arathor Basic Care Package","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/8261-arathor-standard-care-package","n":"Arathor Standard Care Package","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/8374-claiming-arathi-basin","n":"Claiming Arathi Basin","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/8391-claiming-arathi-basin","n":"Claiming Arathi Ba